start
:A / Domain admits current authorised work;
:C1 retrieves original sources + conflicts;\nA / Assessment drafts a candidate packet;
:C1 verifies exact citation references;\nresolvability is not claim support;
note right
<b>Five results, not work phases</b>
PASS → guarded Founder review.
PASS_WITH_WARNING → same;
show warnings.
REVISE → bounded new proposal
and fresh independent review.
NEEDS_INFORMATION → clarification;
accepted answer → new input/review.
ESCALATE → BLOCK visible;
revision/manual only.

<b>Guards and exception exits</b>
Only Domain writes business state.
Stale events cannot change new work.
Incomplete/removed/oversized input:
no partial review.
Technical failure ≠ Risk outcome.
Exhausted REVISE: keep real result
and proposal; stop machine work;
no fabricated ESCALATE reply.
No proposal: genuine failure/order
block → manual only.
end note
:A / Domain validates complete material,\ncapacity and case/input/proposal/corpus;\natomically accepts packet + bundle + audit;
:A / Domain selects; Orchestrator invokes;\nC2 independently reviews accepted input;
:A / Domain checks reply and current identity;\natomically stores valid RiskReview + audit;
:A / Domain routes the accepted outcome;\nno review outcome grants approval;
stop
legend bottom
Full source: member-c-activity.puml (MC-ACT-0.1 / C01-C10).
Bounds: docs/18 MC-D01-03. AI-assisted design;
not runtime verification or personal/team acceptance.
endlegend
